description: Evidence-based completion and systematic debugging
alwaysApply: true
---

# Agent quality

- Do not claim done or fixed without fresh evidence (typecheck, design:lint, test, or runtime check).
- For UI work, `npm run design:lint` must be clean of errors.
- Debug: reproduce → isolate → root cause → fix. Stop after three failed attempts and report.
- Prefer focused diffs. No drive-by refactors.
- Prefer absolute paths in tool calls.
